							Metodologías Agile CI/​CD, IDE Antigravity IA, Astro, Node/​Express, Angular, React, Lit Element, Git/​GitHub, GoogleCharts/​HighCharts, X-HTML/​S-CSS, Bootstrap/​Taildwind, API RESTful, MySQL y NoSQL/​MongDB,  Docker, Testing en Vitest y Pruebas en cURL/​Postman.
